 The content is the real work and it hashes to the digest it was quoted
 by. It is offered with no signature at all.

 A hash says what a definition is. Only a signature says who stands
 behind it. An unsigned work is not anonymous code we might take a
 chance on -- it is code with nobody to hold responsible for it, and no
 score to weigh, because there is no one to score.

